name: ['Angel of Flight Alabaster', "Avacyn's Collar", "Avacyn's Pilgrim", 'Avacyn, Angel of Hope', 'Balefire Dragon', 'Barter in Blood', 'Battleground Geist', 'Blazing Torch', 'Bloodflow Connoisseur', 'Bloodline Keeper // Lord of Lineage', 'Bonds of Faith', 'Brimstone Volley', 'Bump in the Night', "Butcher's Cleaver", 'Cackling Counterpart', 'Demonmail Hauberk', "Devil's Play", 'Diregraf Captain', 'Divine Reckoning', 'Doomed Traveler', 'Drogskol Captain', 'Elder Cathar', 'Evolving Wilds', 'Faithless Looting', 'Falkenrath Aristocrat', 'Falkenrath Noble', 'Feeling of Dread', 'Fiend Hunter', 'Forbidden Alchemy', 'Forge Devil', 'Galvanic Juggernaut', 'Garruk Relentless // Garruk, the Veil-Cursed', 'Geist of Saint Traft', 'Ghoulraiser', 'Gnaw to the Bone', 'Griselbrand', 'Gutter Grime', 'Haunted Fengraf', 'Havengul Lich', 'Havengul Runebinder', 'Hollowhenge Scavenger', 'Huntmaster of the Fells // Ravager of the Fells', 'Immerwolf', 'Increasing Ambition', 'Invisible Stalker', 'Kruin Outlaw // Terror of Kruin Pass', 'Lingering Souls', 'Mayor of Avabruck // Howlpack Alpha', 'Mist Raven', 'Moonmist', 'Murder of Crows', 'Mystic Retrieval', 'Past in Flames', 'Rally the Peasants', 'Requiem Angel', 'Selhoff Occultist', 'Sever the Bloodline', 'Sigarda, Host of Herons', 'Silent Departure', 'Skirsdag Cultist', 'Skirsdag High Priest', 'Snapcaster Mage', 'Somberwald Sage', 'Spider Spawning', "Stitcher's Apprentice", 'Stromkirk Captain', 'Séance', 'Tragic Slip', 'Traitorous Blood', 'Travel Preparations', "Traveler's Amulet", 'Unburial Rites', 'Vampiric Fury', 'Vessel of Endless Rest', 'Young Wolf', 'Zealous Conscripts']
